WEBVTT

00:08:00.017 --> 00:08:03.604
to imagine different worlds
and different futures.

00:08:05.523 --> 00:08:09.235
It's not too late to change
machine evolution

00:08:09.235 --> 00:08:11.362
and to consider new goals,

00:08:11.403 --> 00:08:15.991
where machines and humans can coexist

00:08:15.991 --> 00:08:17.868
in a more compassionate way.

00:08:19.328 --> 00:08:22.915
I believe this is where we can
start the conversation.

00:08:23.958 --> 00:08:30.965
(Applause)